<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Demo Sanitasi Input</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 min-h-screen">
  <%- include('../partials/demo-nav', { title: '2. Sanitasi Input' }) %>

  <main class="max-w-xl mx-auto px-4 pb-10">
    <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 text-blue-800 text-sm rounded-lg px-4 py-3 mb-6">
      Beda sama validasi (yang NOLAK data gak sesuai aturan), sanitasi itu
      NGUBAH input jadi bentuk aman/rapi — walau inputnya "valid" secara aturan.
      Coba ketik teks pake spasi di depan/belakang, atau simbol HTML kayak
      <code>&lt;b&gt;tes&lt;/b&gt;</code>, terus liat hasil "sesudah"-nya.
    </div>

    <% if (before) { %>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 mb-6">
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-4">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-400 mb-1">SEBELUM disanitasi (raw dari form)</p>
          <pre class="text-sm bg-gray-50 rounded p-2 overflow-x-auto"><%= JSON.stringify(before, null, 2) %></pre>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-green-200 rounded-xl p-4">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-green-600 mb-1">SESUDAH disanitasi (yang beneran masuk ke req.body controller)</p>
          <pre class="text-sm bg-green-50 rounded p-2 overflow-x-auto"><%= JSON.stringify(after, null, 2) %></pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    <% } %>

    <form method="POST" action="/demo/sanitasi" class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-5 space-y-3">
      <div>
        <label class="text-sm text-gray-600 block mb-1">Teks bebas (coba " &lt;b&gt;tes&lt;/b&gt; " pake spasi)</label>
        <input type="text" name="teks" class="w-full border border-gray-300 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm" />
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1">Aturan: <code>.trim().escape()</code></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label class="text-sm text-gray-600 block mb-1">Email (coba "Budi.Santoso+promo@GMAIL.com")</label>
        <input type="text" name="email_input" class="w-full border border-gray-300 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm" />
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1">Aturan: <code>.trim().normalizeEmail()</code></p>
      </div>
      <button class="w-full bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-semibold py-2 rounded-lg text-sm">
        Sanitasi sekarang
      </button>
    </form>

    <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-4">
      Aturan lengkap ada di <code>middlewares/validators.js</code> →
      <code>sanitasiDemoRules</code>.
    </p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
